cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or reference IREP, please cite it as below."
title: "IREP — Individual-Referential Evaluation Protocol"
abstract: "A free, open, non-proprietary and not-for-sale protocol (available to commercial and non-commercial implementers alike) for hiring and admissions: category-blind, trajectory-rich evaluation first; category data flows only through a separate firewalled audit channel, analytically unavailable until decisions are finalized, for lawful administrative, compliance and equity-audit purposes. The individual is the reference class; the population is the audit instrument."
type: software
